OL,3,ACourt of Appeal overturns ban on
OL,4,ADrumcree parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Court of Appeal has overturned a
OL,7,Fban on Orangemen marching through a
OL,8,Flargely nationalist part of Northern
OL,9,FIreland on Sunday.
OL,11,FHowever, a late night High Court
OL,12,Fsitting began just after midnight to
OL,13,Fconsider the original legal challenge
OL,14,Ftaken by residents to the parade.
OL,16,FThe parade, which in the 1990s sparked
OL,17,Fsome of the most serious disorder in
OL,18,FNorthern Ireland's history, had been
OL,19,Fgiven permission to go ahead along the
OL,20,FGarvaghy Road route in Portadown for
OL,21,Fthe first time in almost three decades,
OL,22,Fwith restrictions in place.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
